600 
;HETEROGEN
PNE IS PARA-NITROPHENYL PHOSPHONOBUTANOYL L-ALANINE 
(NO2-C6H5-O-PO2-CH2-CH2-CH2-CO-NH-CH(CH3)-COOH)
;
999 
;SEQUENCE    
THE SEQUENCES OF THE CONSTANT DOMAINS OF THE HEAVY CHAINS.
(RESIDUES H106 - H223) AND OF THE LIGHT CHAINS
(RESIDUES L107 - L214) HAVE NOT BEEN DETERMINED FOR THIS
IMMUNOGLOBULIN. THEY HAVE BEEN ASSIGNED THE CONSENSUS
SEQUENCE FOR THE CONSTANT DOMAIN OF MOUSE KAPPA LIGHT
CHAIN AND FOR THE FIRST CONSTANT DOMAIN OF MOUSE GROUP
2A HEAVY CHAINS.
;
# 
